        "PMC6478865::web::005::materials_processing"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated starting material has limited room-temperature ductility, exemplified as less than 10% elongation, and moderate yield strength.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 30–50% cold- or warm-rolling reduction is an appropriate deformation step for the proposed treatment.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::005::materials_processing",
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rolling should be followed by a brief sub-critical annealing treatment.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6478865::web::005::materials_processing",
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rolling-and-annealing treatment refines the lamellar morphology.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment causes partial recrystallization and produces smaller grains or phase regions.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC6478865::web::005::materials_processing"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment produces finer colony-boundary spacing and a more uniform distribution of grains and phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decreasing lamellar spacing and generating finer substructures reduce the effective dislocation slip length.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced effective slip length decreases dislocation pile-ups at internal boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Decreasing dislocation pile-ups lowers local stress concentrations at internal boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower boundary stress concentrations suppress microcrack initiation and delay catastrophic failure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Retained boundary and precipitation strengthening mechanisms preserve or improve yield strength after treatment.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated material will reach approximately 10–15% elongation to failure and will be more ductile than the untreated material.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will maintain or moderately increase yield and ultimate tensile strength relative to the untreated material.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted strength and ductility improvements apply under room-temperature tensile loading in ambient atmosphere.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
